This file is a placeholder for the kubernetes-network-topology.png diagram.

When creating this diagram, please follow these guidelines:
1. The diagram should illustrate the Kubernetes network topology of the VIP Platform
2. Include the pod and service network CIDR allocations
3. Show how traffic flows between pods, services, and external resources
4. Illustrate network policies, ingress/egress controls, and security boundaries
5. Show integration with the broader VPC/VNet network architecture
6. Use the standard color scheme and symbols from our diagram guidelines
7. Export as PNG with a resolution of at least 1200x800
8. Include a legend explaining all symbols used

Please replace this placeholder with the actual diagram when complete. 